A: The problem is that the \MV macro is defined in the mv.sty file, which is not loaded by the mv.cls file.
You can fix this by adding the following lines to your preamble:
\usepackage{mv}
\let\MV\undefined

This will load the mv.sty file and then redefine the \MV macro to be undefined.
